	(gr_text "trigger modes:\n- midi > oscillators are triggered by a midi input; both the note trigger and pitch\n- sequencer > section is trigger by each active sequencer stage\n- pulser > section is triggered by the high point of the pulser signal \n- clock > section is triggered by the clock speed\n\nenvelope generator modes:\n- transient > envelope sustains only for the sustain duration\n- sustrain > envelope sustains \n- oscillating > envelope repeats like an oscillator\n\ndual lo pass gate modes:\n- lo pass filter > modulation source controls the cut-off frequency of the lo pass\n- combination > modulation source controls the cut-off freq. and the vca\n- voltage ctrld. amp > modulation source controls the vca\n\nbuttons:\n- '*' next to a label represents the default mode assigned upon booting up"
